<section class="hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Delgado FCE Solutions / Referral Inquiries</div><h1>Get a Quote.<br>Start with Clarity.</h1><p>Request information about an individualized Functional Capacity Evaluation. Tell us a little about your referral needs and Ricardo Delgado, PT, DPT, FAAOMPT can be contacted directly to discuss the next steps.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="#quote-form" class="btn btn-green">Request a Quote →</a><a href="tel:+12103878979" class="btn btn-outline">Call (210) 387-8979</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">A Professional Starting Point</div><h2>Objective Assessment Begins with the Right Questions.</h2><p>Whether you represent an injured client, work in healthcare, or are seeking an evaluation for yourself, Delgado FCE Solutions can discuss the functional questions relevant to the referral.</p><div class="note"><strong>Privacy first:</strong> Please do not include patient names, diagnoses, dates of birth, medical records, or other sensitive health information in this initial inquiry.</div></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="stepnum">01</div><div><h3>Share General Referral Details</h3><p>Provide your contact information, role, and the broad purpose of the evaluation.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="stepnum">02</div><div><h3>Discuss the Evaluation</h3><p>Clarify the relevant functional questions and the type of information needed.</p></div></div><div class="step"><div class="stepnum">03</div><div><h3>Review Next Steps</h3><p>Contact the practice to discuss evaluation details, scheduling considerations, and a quote.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section quote-wrap" id="quote-form"><div class="container quote-grid"><div class="form-card"><div class="eyebrow">Evaluation Inquiry</div><h2>Request Your Quote</h2><p>Complete the form below. Required fields are marked with an asterisk.</p><form id="quoteForm"><div class="form-section-title">Your Contact Information</div><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="name">Full Name <span class="req">*</span></label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="Your full name" maxlength="120"></div><div class="field"><label for="organization">Organization / Firm</label><input id="organization" name="organization" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Firm or organization name" maxlength="150"></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Email Address <span class="req">*</span></label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="name@example.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone Number <span class="req">*</span></label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="(210) 000-0000" maxlength="40"></div><div class="field full"><label for="role">I Am a... <span class="req">*</span></label><select id="role" name="role" required><option value="">Select your role</option><option>Personal-Injury Attorney / Law Firm</option><option>Healthcare Professional</option><option>Case Manager</option><option>Injured Individual</option><option>Other</option></select></div></div><div class="form-section-title">Evaluation Request</div><div class="fields"><div class="field"><label for="purpose">Primary Reason for Inquiry <span class="req">*</span></label><select id="purpose" name="purpose" required><option value="">Select a reason</option><option>Personal-Injury Functional Assessment</option><option>Work Capacity Assessment</option><option>Functional Limitations Assessment</option><option>General FCE Inquiry</option><option>Other / Not Sure</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="timeline">Preferred Timeframe</label><select id="timeline" name="timeline"><option value="">Select a timeframe</option><option>As Soon As Available</option><option>Within 2–4 Weeks</option><option>Within 1–2 Months</option><option>Flexible / To Be Discussed</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label for="message">General Questions or Referral Goals</label><textarea id="message" name="message" maxlength="1500" placeholder="Describe the general functional questions you would like to discuss. Please do not enter private patient or medical information."></textarea></div><div class="field full"><label for="contactMethod">Preferred Contact Method</label><select id="contactMethod" name="contactMethod"><option>Email</option><option>Phone</option><option>Either</option></select></div></div><div class="privacy"><input type="checkbox" id="agree" required><label for="agree">I understand this form opens an email draft on my device and is not a secure portal for patient or medical information. <span class="req">*</span></label></div><button class="btn btn-green submit" type="submit">Prepare Quote Request Email →</button><p class="smallprint">Submitting opens your email application with the information entered. You must review and send the email yourself. No quote or appointment is confirmed by this form.</p></form></div><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sidecard dark"><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#a8d86b">Direct Professional Contact</div><h3>Prefer to Speak Directly?</h3><p>Reach out to Delgado FCE Solutions to discuss a referral or evaluation inquiry.</p><div class="contact-row"><span>Call</span><a href="tel:+12103878979">(210) 387-8979</a></div><div class="contact-row"><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:Ricky.Delgado.DPT@gmail.com">Ricky.Delgado.DPT@gmail.com</a></div></div><div class="sidecard"><div class="eyebrow">What an FCE Can Address</div><h3>Focused on Function</h3><ul><li>Strength and mobility</li><li>Lifting, carrying, pushing, and pulling</li><li>Activity and positional tolerances</li><li>Work-related physical demands</li><li>Daily activity limitations</li><li>Consistency of performance</li></ul></div><div class="sidecard"><div class="eyebrow">Clinical Leadership</div><h3>Ricardo Delgado</h3><p><strong>PT, DPT, FAAOMPT</strong><br>Doctor of Physical Therapy</p><p>Individualized evaluation and objective clinical findings.</p></div></aside></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container faq"><div class="eyebrow">Common Questions</div><h2>Before You Request an Evaluation</h2><details><summary>Can an attorney request a quote for a client?</summary><p>Yes. Attorneys and law firms can contact Delgado FCE Solutions to discuss the functional assessment needs of a personal-injury case.</p></details><details><summary>What information should I include in my initial inquiry?</summary><p>Include your name, contact details, professional role, general reason for the inquiry, and preferred timeframe. Avoid sharing identifiable patient or medical information.</p></details><details><summary>Does the form confirm an appointment or price?</summary><p>No. It prepares an email inquiry. Evaluation details, pricing, and scheduling must be discussed directly with the practice.</p></details><details><summary>Who performs the evaluations?</summary><p>Ricardo Delgado, PT, DPT, FAAOMPT, Doctor of Physical Therapy.</p></details></div></section>
